OL,3,GNEWSAPM backs rural market town's bid
OL,4,Afor new rail link
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prime Minister has said he supports
OL,7,Fplans for a new rail station in a
OL,8,Fmarket town.
OL,10,FMP Brian Mathew took his long-running
OL,11,Fcampaign for the two-platform station
OL,12,Fnear Lydeway in Devizes, Wiltshire to
OL,13,FPrime Minister's Questions (PMQs) this
OL,14,Fweek.
OL,16,FAndy Burnham said he would like to see
OL,17,Fthe infrastructure for Devizes Gateway
OL,18,FRailway Station delivered, and that he
OL,19,F"cared" about that part of the county.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
