OL,3,GNEWSAPM backs rural market town's bid
OL,4,Afor new rail link
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat MP Mathew told BBC
OL,7,FRadio Wiltshire the proposal now looked
OL,8,F"realistic", and the Department for
OL,9,FTransport (DfT) said it would carefully
OL,10,Fconsider any future proposals from
OL,11,FWiltshire Council.
